  "transcript": [
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Olga Ivanova",
      "persona_id": "D4",
      "group": "D",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 26,
      "text": "We need to consider the risks with Alpha Ridge. The summit is unstable after the landslide, and we can't put our equipment in danger like that."
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Quinn Doherty",
      "persona_id": "N13",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 22,
      "text": "I think we really need to reconsider Alpha Ridge. With those winds approaching, deploying there could be a disaster for our equipment."
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Pia Kowalski",
      "persona_id": "P4",
      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 20,
      "text": "We can't ignore the risks at Alpha Ridge. The instability from the landslide is a real concern for our equipment."
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Dev Raman",
      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 31,
      "text": "I understand the concerns about Alpha Ridge. But I'm wondering if we've fully considered the potential benefits of deploying there as well. We could capture some critical data if conditions allow."
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Rania Khoury",
      "persona_id": "N14",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 28,
      "text": "I see the concerns about Alpha Ridge, but we should weigh the potential benefits carefully. It might be worth considering our options more thoroughly before dismissing it completely."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Olga Ivanova",
      "persona_id": "D4",
      "group": "D",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 21,
      "text": "We can't ignore the instability at Alpha Ridge. Deploying there could jeopardize our equipment, and we need to prioritize safety first."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Rania Khoury",
      "persona_id": "N14",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 23,
      "text": "I understand the safety concerns, but we also need to think about the data we might miss if we avoid Alpha Ridge entirely."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Pia Kowalski",
      "persona_id": "P4",
      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 25,
      "text": "I hear what you're saying, but we need to be realistic about the risks involved with Alpha Ridge. Let's not overlook the potential consequences here."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Quinn Doherty",
      "persona_id": "N13",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 21,
      "text": "We seriously need to rethink Alpha Ridge. Those winds could really jeopardize everything. It's just not worth the risk right now."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Dev Raman",
      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 29,
      "text": "I get the concerns about Alpha Ridge. But aren't we overlooking the data we could gather if we deploy there? It might be worth the risk if conditions allow."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Pia Kowalski",
      "persona_id": "P4",
      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 21,
      "text": "I understand the potential for valuable data, but the risks at Alpha Ridge are significant. We have to be cautious here."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Quinn Doherty",
      "persona_id": "N13",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 21,
      "text": "I really think we have to reconsider Alpha Ridge. Those winds are coming fast, and it could jeopardize everything we’ve planned."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Dev Raman",
      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 29,
      "text": "I see where everyone's coming from with the concerns. But we need to balance the risks with the potential data we could collect. It might be worth considering that."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Rania Khoury",
      "persona_id": "N14",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 28,
      "text": "I know we have concerns about Alpha Ridge, but we should really think about the data we could miss out on if we don't consider it at all."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Olga Ivanova",
      "persona_id": "D4",
      "group": "D",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 20,
      "text": "We really need to address the risks at Alpha Ridge. Ignoring the instability could put our whole project in jeopardy."
